 "description": "<p>A bride costume in jumpsuit form: one lace mesh piece, as pictured, one size for 40-60 kg. The single-garment approach means the bride silhouette survives movement, sitting, and whatever else the night involves.</p>\n<p>Lace mesh gives the sweet-and-sheer balance the listing promises - readable as bridal from across a room, transparent at conversational distance. No veil in this version; the lace pattern carries the theme alone.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: lace mesh</li>\n<li>Item type: jumpsuit</li>\n<li>Style: bride</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Fits 40-60 kg. The one-piece bride answer for anyone who has lost pieces of a three-part set before.</p>\n",
